# Headless fixture for the WRITE retirement (ABI-002, tests/headless
# console-route): routes its debug text into its logstore ring
# (CuBit.Console_Route); the markers reach the serial console only through
# test builds' logstore mirror (Test_Console_ABI).
(Executable_Manifest
  identity => "com.cubit.console-route-check"
  version => "0.1.0"
  requests => [(service "logstore" "logstore")])
